# React UI

- Functional components. Colocate feature UI with the page unless it is shared chrome.
- Icon-only buttons need `aria-label`. Escape closes popovers. Decorative icons `aria-hidden`.
- For UI/layout/a11y work: read `ui-skills-root`, then at most 2–3 skills (`interface-design`, `transitions-dev`, `fixing-accessibility`, `baseline-ui`, `polish`). Prefer existing `index.css` over new animation libraries.
- Prefill create flows from query params (see `/transactions?renew=1`) rather than extra modal routes.
